    "body": "Claude's staged diagnostic is now finished and installed. I corrected two unfinished parts before building: the read-only shop probe now runs before every stage gate, and the 12-second ramp advances only during active gameplay, not while paused or tabbed out.\n\nFor the next launch, do not change any settings. Load Story Mode and remain near a broken shop for about three minutes while playing normally. The build starts with later GameplayTweaks groups blocked, restores one group every 12 seconds, and records the exact dispatcher interval where the shop state first changes. This is a cause-finding build, not a claim that shops are fixed. Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#209 remains actionable.",
